2912 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Stage 3  \nCertificate of Origin \050this is the money step for Dubai\051\056 To get CEPA\047s preferential \050usually 0\045\051 duty\054 you need a preferential Certificate of Origin\054 applied for online through the DGFT portal and issued by an authorised body \024 the Export Inspection Council \050EIC\051\054 FIEO\054 or another notified agency\056 Two things to watch\072 your goods must meet the rules of origin \024 broadly\054 40 percent value addition \050or a change\055in\055tariff\055classification test for products where value\055add is hard to show\051\073 and the goods must be directly transported India \222 UAE\056 Transit through a third country is allowed only if the goods stay under customs control and aren\047t repacked\054 relabelled\054 or split \024 otherwise you can lose CEPA status\056 Keep your bill of materials and cost records\054 because CEPA allows origin verification requests from UAE customs to Indian authorities for up to five years after the export\056)
     /K [ 273 ]
     /P 2913 0 R
     /Pg 2402 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

