2916 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Stage 4 \nClear Indian customs\056 You \050or your Customs House Agent\051 file a Shipping Bill electronically on ICEGATE\054 upload supporting documents via e\055Sanchit\054 and the shipment goes through the Risk Management System check\056 Once cleared\054 customs issues the \042Let Export Order\042 \050LEO\051 \024 that\047s the green light for the goods to physically leave India\056 The Shipping Bill is doing double duty\072 it\047s your proof of export and the basis for claiming incentives and GST refund later\056)
     /K [ 275 ]
     /P 2917 0 R
     /Pg 2402 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

