2920 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Stage 5  \nShip and clear Dubai customs\056 Goods move via Jebel Ali Port \050sea \024 the busiest port in the Middle East\051 or Dubai International Airport \050air\051\056 On the UAE side\054 your buyer\057importer needs a Dubai Customs code to clear the goods\056 Standard UAE customs duty is 5\045\054 but with your valid preferential CoO under CEPA it drops to 0\045 on most product lines\056 Goods routed through a Dubai free zone are exempt from standard duties entirely \050useful if the plan is re\055export onward into the wider GCC\057Middle East\051\056 One easy\055to\055miss compliance point\072 except for food shipments\054 export documents for the UAE generally require attestation\057legalisation \050UAE Embassy in India \222 MOFA in UAE\051\056 Food shipments instead need a health certificate\054 and meat\057poultry need a halal certificate\056)
     /K [ 277 ]
     /P 2921 0 R
     /Pg 2402 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

