2924 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Stage 6 \nGet paid and claim incentives\056 Payment comes in against your AD Code\055linked bank account\056 Then you claim back\072 RoDTEP \050remission of embedded duties\057taxes\054 issued as transferable e\055credit scrips on ICEGATE\051\054 duty drawback where applicable\054 and your GST refund on the zero\055rated export \024 the ICEGATE Shipping Bill effectively acts as the refund application once it matches your GST returns\056)
     /K [ 279 ]
     /P 2925 0 R
     /Pg 2402 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
