2926 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Does it differ by destination country\077 Yes \024 but only the second half\nThis is the key mental model\072 the India\055side machinery is identical no matter where you ship\056 IEC\054 GST\054 AD Code\054 RCMC\054 filing the Shipping Bill on ICEGATE\054 RoDTEP\057drawback\057GST refund \024 same for Dubai\054 Sydney\054 Zurich\054 or a country with no trade deal at all\056 What changes is the trade\055agreement layer and destination compliance\072\nWhat a Free Trade Agreement changes\072 not your freight cost \024 it changes the import duty your buyer pays at the destination\056 Concessions range from 0 to 25 percent duty savings depending on product and partner\056 Each FTA has its own tariff schedule\054 its own rules of origin\054 and its own CoO rules\056 )
     /K [ 280 ]
     /P 2935 0 R
     /Pg 2402 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

